## Scope — what this licence does NOT cover

The MIT licence above applies to the original work in this repository: everything under
`firmware/`, `docs/`, `design/`, and the repository's own documentation.

It does **not** apply to:

- **`backup/factory_release/*.bin`** — the stock LilyGO firmware images. These are a byte-for-byte
  capture of the firmware LilyGO ship pre-installed on the T-Dongle-S3, redistributed here as a
  recovery path because the board has no OTA slot and reflashing destroys them permanently.
  Copyright LilyGO / Xinyuan; see `backup/factory_release/README.md` for full attribution and
  <https://github.com/Xinyuan-LilyGO/T-Dongle-S3> for the originals.

- **`hardware/T-Dongle-S3-schematic.pdf`** — LilyGO's schematic for their board, from the same
  repository.

- **Third-party libraries** pulled in at build time (Arduino-ESP32, ESP-IDF, ArduinoJson,
  Adafruit GFX/ST7735 and others). Each carries its own licence; none are vendored here.
